            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Debbie Ramirez"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is so good! I used a frozen pie crust. I also didn’t have a name brand corn syrup and added one cup each of the chocolate chips and one cup of pecans like a previous reviewer suggested. I had to cook it for an hour and fifteen minutes for it to set up. I placed foil around the edges of the crust at about 50 minutes cooking time. Overall wonderful and extremely easy pie! My husband loves it. Recommend!",
            "datePublished": "2018-12-22T01:28:30.490Z"
          },
